    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">On November 12, 2026, the Reporting Person contributed 500,000 shares of Class C capital stock to the Kavitark R. Shriram TR UA 10/30/26 2026 RS Irrevocable Trust  (2026 GRAT) of which the Reporting Person is the sole trustee retaining investment control over the shares held by the 2026 GRAT, and the sole recipient of the annuity payments made by the 2026 GRAT.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">On November 12, 2026, the Reporting Person's spouse contributed 500,000 shares of Class C capital stock to the Vidjealatchoumy Shriram TR UA 10/30/26 2026 VS Irrevocable Trust (2026 VS GRAT) of which the Reporting Person's spouse is the sole trustee retaining investment control over the shares held by the 2026 VS GRAT, and the sole recipient of the annuity payments made by the 2026 VS GRAT.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">The Reporting Person is trustee and beneficiary of the Ram Shriram TR UA 10/28/2022 RS Irrevocable Trust.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">The Reporting Person's spouse is trustee and beneficiary of the Vijay Shriram TR UA 10/28/2022 2022 VS Irrevocable Trust.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F5">The Reporting Person is both trustee and sole annuitant of the 2025 RS Irrevocable Trust dated 4/10/25.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F6">The Reporting Person's spouse is both trustee and sole annuitant of the 2025 VS Irrevocable Trust dated 4/10/25.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F7">The Google Stock Units (GSUs) entitle the Reporting Person to receive one share of Alphabet Inc. Class C Capital Stock for each share underlying the GSU as GSU vests. 1/48th of GSUs vested on July 25, 2023 and an additional 1/48th of GSUs vests on the 25th day of each month thereafter, subject to continued service on the Board on the applicable vesting dates.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F8">1/48 of GSUs will vest on the 25th day of each month following the grant date for 31 months and on the 1st day of each month for the following 17 months, subject to continued service on the Board on the applicable vesting dates.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F9">1/48 of GSUs will vest on the 25th day of each month following the grant date for 19 months and on the 1st day of each month for the following 29 months, subject to continued service on the Board on the applicable vesting dates.
8. 1/48th of GSUs vested on July 25, 2023 and an additional 1/48th of GSUs vests on the 25th day of each month thereafter, subject to continued service on the Board on the applicable vesting dates.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F10">1/48 of GSUs shall vest on the 25th of the month of the Grant Date, vesting 1/48 every 1 month(s) for 7 event(s); 1/48 of GSUs shall vest on the 1st of the month 7 month(s) after the Grant Date, vesting 1/48 every 1 month(s) for 41 event(s), subject to continued employment on such vesting date(s).</footnote>
